					"speakerTitle": "蘭迦魯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730632005,
					"content": "我也想學！蘭迦魯以後一定要教我呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730632006
